{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10282090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10282090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1028209001:1":{"text":"바람이시여, 저의 목소리를 들어주세요... 제게 만물의 메시지를 전해주세요...","source_cn":"风啊，我请求您倾听我的声音……带给我万物的讯息……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DD7FA2BFA3AB44D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028209002:1":{"text":"방랑자는 바람과 이렇게 대화하는 거겠지...?","source_cn":"风语者是这样和风对话的吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x173B6718AA3E5BF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028209003:0":{"text":"그런데 왜 바람의 소리가 안 들리는 거지... 내가 뭔가 잘못한 건가?","source_cn":"但是，为什么听不到风的声音……是我哪里做得不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5A916F6D4A6E139","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028210001:1":{"text":"저 아이가 바람의 소리를 들을 수 있게 된다면 아카데미로 돌아가지 않을까?","source_cn":"你说，如果他听到风的声音，是不是就愿意回学院了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E9904759B693A85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028210002:0":{"text":"치피... 드디어 똑똑해진거얏?!","source_cn":"满满终于说了一句聪明话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D199DE1F880B120","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028210003:0":{"text":"어... 음, 맞다! 마스터, 저 아이를 위해 바람 원소를 불러주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"唔……嗯，有了！主人，拜托你为他召唤一只风元素好不好？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x93B2DC5326CB9CC9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어... 음, 맞다! 마스터, 저 아이를 위해 바람 원소를 불러주실 수 있나요?","female":"어... 음, 맞다! 마스터, 저 아이를 위해 바람 원소를 불러주실 수 있나요?","variant_male_record_index":"110962","variant_female_record_index":"110963","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028210004:1":{"text":"바람 원소가 나타나면, 바람과의 교감에 성공한 셈이잖아요! 그럼 저 아이도 안심하고 아카데미로 돌아가지 않을까요?","source_cn":"风元素出现，也算是他的交流成功了吧！也许这样他就能安心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA9E581994C05CA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1028210004":{"text":"바람 원소가 나타나면, 바람과의 교감에 성공한 셈이잖아요! 그럼 저 아이도 안심하고 아카데미로 돌아가지 않을까요?","source_cn":"风元素出现，也算是他的交流成功了吧！也许这样他就能安心回学校去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA9E581994C05CA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028210005:0":{"text":"봐, 랜디가 바람 원소를 발견했어!","source_cn":"瞧，兰迪看到风元素了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20C1EDBD8FBC03AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1028210006:0":{"text":"기뻐하는 것 같아! 헤헤, 이젠 만족했겠지!","source_cn":"他看上去很高兴！嘿嘿，这下他该心满意足了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37008551480B8691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1028211001:0":{"text":"바람... 바람이다! 내... 내 소환을 들었구나, 그렇지?","source_cn":"风……是风！你……你听到我的召唤了，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E05F5F0FE07C582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1028211002:1":{"text":"정말 대단해! 미샤르테 님께서 정말 방랑자의 특성을 주셨어!","source_cn":"太棒了！弥萨忒真的赐予了我风语天赋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99CEA41BFF8933B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1028211003:1":{"text":"우리 엄마, 아빠한테 메시지를 좀 전해줄래? 그냥... 아, 내가 이제 바람과 대화할 수 있게 되었다고, 더 크면, 최고의...","source_cn":"请你传个信息给我的爸爸妈妈好不好？就说……对，就说我现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040187CAF883ECB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1028211004:0":{"text":"...음? 왜 바람이 점점 거세지는 거지? 바람아, 내 말을 좀 들어봐, 이렇게 흥분하지 말고...","source_cn":"……嗯？怎么风越来越大了，风啊，聆听我的话语，请你不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C10DBE564E9B741","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1028211005:0":{"text":"치피는 왜 바람 원소가 기분이 안 좋은 거 같죠...","source_cn":"满满怎么觉得风元素有点不太高兴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x448220F6EF16693B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1028211006:0":{"text":"큰일 났어, 바람의 언어를 아예 할 줄 몰라. 이런 식으로 “소통”하다간 바람 원소는 도발하고 있다고 느낄 거야!","source_cn":"糟了，他根本不会风语。这样“沟通”，风元素可能会觉得他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC338DC0DB92D9209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1028211007:0":{"text":"어떻게 된 거지... 내, 내 말을 좀 들어봐...","source_cn":"怎么回事……听我、听我说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF59359E25801F90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1028211008:0":{"text":"오, 오지 마!!","source_cn":"别、别过来——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB61BFF461B718087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1028211009:0":{"text":"큰일이야, 바람 원소가 폭주하려고 해! 어, 어서 막아야 해!","source_cn":"不好，风元素狂暴了！快、快阻止它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD09E1C7E16E18C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:41:10282223:0":{"text":"랜디는 내가 소환한 바람 원소를 발견하고 아주 기뻐했다.","source_cn":"兰迪看到了你召唤出来的风元素，似乎非常高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE917D9528FF53783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":